     2311           DOWN stream Out-Stream 1 with FRAME invent .
     2312           Put stream Out-Stream LineBuf format "x(185)":U skip.
     2313         End.
     2314         when  "sl"  THEN DO:
     2315           display stream Out-Stream
     2316             "ИТОГО"      @  temp-str.artic
     2317             sym1 sym2 sym3 sym4 sym5 sym6 sym7 sym9 sym10 sym12  sym13  sym14
     2318             sum1-a-qnty   @ temp-str.a-qnty
     2319             sum1-a-stoim  @ temp-str.a-stoim
     2320             sum1-b-qnty   @ temp-str.b-qnty
     2321             sum1-b-stoim  @ temp-str.b-stoim
     2322             sum1-ubl      @ temp-str.ubl
     2323           with FRAME sl.
     2324           DOWN stream Out-Stream 1 with FRAME sl .
